lass=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 8 grids runs from 1951 to 2025, and February to March came in under 90% of normal in 36 of 75 years, more than any other pair. In 2025 the middle saw April to May at 167% of normal and July to August at just 63%. So far in 2026, March to April sits at 54% of normal on the middle. On grid 20582 the preliminary estimate for August to September 2026 is 78.6, and RMA&rsquo;s final index can differ.</p>"}
